\newlabel{fig:system}{{1}{2}{Final proposed design. The new runtime component is the green memory monitor; fitting runs between deployments. Evidence, rule versions, and optional object snapshots share one logical store. Arrows from learning denote validated updates, never self-issued authority. The existing shield must still be checked for geometry, dynamics, and actuator correctness}{figure.1}{}}
